config BR2_PACKAGE_T23_IPA
	bool "t23-ipa"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  Automatic exposure, white balance, colour correction, noise
	  reduction and day/night IR-cut control for the Ingenic T23 ISP.
	  The daemon reads hardware statistics and queues ISP parameters via
	  V4L2 metadata nodes and drives sensor exposure, gain and vblank
	  controls via the Media Controller topology, alongside whichever
	  application streams from the capture device.
